y with a staging site</a></h3><p class=\"brxe-cvrtwd brxe-text-basic card-v2__text\">Updates keep a site secure, but they occasionally break things. A staging site lets you find out before your visitors do.</p></article></li>","923":"<li class=\"brxe-zcfzjc brxe-div grid-list__item\" data-ss-id=\"923\"><article class=\"brxe-kmlbmm brxe-div card-v2 brxp-surface2 brxp-clickable-box\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/shipstatic-pages-test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1067-3-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"brxe-lbeuse brxe-image card-v2__media css-filter size-large\" alt=\"A person holding a phone in front of an open laptop.\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/shipstatic-pages-test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1067-3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /shipstatic-pages-test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1067-3-300x200.jpg 300w, /shipstatic-pages-test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1067-3-768x512.jpg 768w, /shipstatic-pages-test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1067-3-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /shipstatic-pages-test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1067-3-1200x800.jpg 1200w, /shipstatic-pages-test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1067-3-600x400.jpg 600w, /shipstatic-pages-test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1067-3.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /><p class=\"brxe-yppnpx brxe-text-basic card-v2__kicker\">BRXProd &amp; Bricks · 29 August 2026</p><h3 class=\"brxe-nlxwsq brxe-div card-v2__title\"><a class=\"brxe-coffmw brxe-text-link brxp-clickable-box__link\" href=\"/shipstatic-pages-test/builder-notes-that-live-where-the-work-is/\">Builder notes that live where the work is</a></h3><p class=\"brxe-cvrtwd brxe-text-basic card-v2__text\">Notes in BRXProd attach to the site, a page, an element or just you, so context stays with the thing it is about.</p></article></li>","929":"<li class=\"brxe-zcfzjc brxe-div grid-list__item\" data-ss-id=\"929\"><article class=\"brxe-kmlbmm brxe-div card-v2 brxp-surface2 brxp-clickable-box\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/shipstatic-pages-test/wp-co